E AX3012 467-set-immutable-field.ax:44:14-16 assign-to-immutable "cannot assign to field `no` of `P`: the field is not declared `mut`" #"`no` is not a `mut` field" !"a struct field is immutable unless its declaration marks it `mut`, the rule `let` already follows; until 0.6.0 the marker was parsed and discarded and this store compiled in silence" ?"declare it mutable where `P` is defined: `(mut no : Int)`"
